1 Why pop-test?
***************

   • Catches mistakes early – Helps find problems before real users do.
   • Test coverage with a real meaning - test your systems from head to
     toe
   • Frees you and allows you to refactor and test your systems more
     easily
   • Saves time – No need to test every little part manually, test on
     higher level.
   • Easy to use – Just write simple rules, in a comfy DSL and
     ‘pop-test’ does the rest!
   • Fast and reliable – Built with Rust, a programming language known
     for speed and safety.


